OL,3,AProsecutors seek 25-year prison term
OL,4,Afor 'poison seller' Kenneth Law
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanadian prosecutors are seeking a
OL,7,F25-year prison sentence for a man who
OL,8,Fsold toxic chemicals through online
OL,9,Fsuicide forums in 40 countries.
OL,11,FKenneth Law pleaded guilty in May to 14
OL,12,Fcounts of aiding the suicide deaths of
OL,13,F14 people in Ontario, Canada, though he
OL,14,Fhas admitted to causing the deaths of
OL,15,Fdozens of victims in England and Wales.
OL,17,FThe 61-year-old will not face charges
OL,18,Fin the UK or over any British deaths
OL,19,Funder a plea deal which saw Canadian
OL,20,Fauthorities withdraw more serious
OL,21,Fcharges of murder.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
