OL,3,AProsecutors seek 25-year prison term
OL,4,Afor 'poison seller' Kenneth Law
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring Friday's sentencing hearing in
OL,7,Fan Ontario court, prosecutors stressed
OL,8,Fthat many of his victims were young and
OL,9,Fstruggling with mental distress.
